{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2509;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\b\f0\fs20 Crumbling Islands\b0\par
\fs16\par
Old, powerful magic has kept these islands floating high up in the skies for centuries. Now the power of the ancient magic is fading, and the islands are beginning to crumble under the feet of their last inhabitants.\par
\par
The clonks do not want to leave the islands behind, at least not before they have managed to make use of their valuable resources. The time is not on their side however, as the last of the islands will likely fall in a matter of hours.\par
\par
To win you must build a blimp and bank at least 200 money points.\par
